---

Companion plugins (detected at runtime, never bundled): arbiter's skill-detector
recognises external Claude Code skill suites already installed in the user's
environment -- Superpowers (https://github.com/obra/superpowers, MIT) and
ponytail (https://github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail, MIT) among them -- and
references them instead of duplicating equivalent content. arbiter ships no
third-party skill text. See the "Companion plugins" section of
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for the full, generated list.
